  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Compounds which results in the formation of stable carbocation upon treating with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will produce precipitate.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2ff51112-7af7-4d82-91ad-ddbf7f469ca8.png\" style=\"width: 521px; height: 391px;\" /></p><p>In the above carbocations, the second carbocation is unstable, hence, it cannot&nbsp;give precipitate with silver nitrate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
